  "contract": [
    "Original Spell.dbc Build: Sentry Turret 500239 says activate again to deconstruct, one turret at a time.",
    "807293 has tooltip You have a Sentry Turret active! and 500470 is Deconstruct Sentry Turret. Normal",
    "building must expose that indicator and replace the build button; using the replacement must remove the",
    "turret, indicator and replacement, then permit rebuilding. The rebuilt turret is killed by a hostile",
    "native area attack to check that death also restores the build button and removes the indicator.",
    "The indicator is temporary summon state. Saving and reloading the character must retain an ordinary Arcane",
    "Intellect aura but not a vanished Sentry or its indicator. Use the native save/logout/login action and",
    "retain ordinary build and deconstruct casts.",
    "A same-level native creature casts the original Decoy Explosive six times, preserving its real hit rolls.",
    "The actual turret death must clear the indicator and restore Build while its owner remains alive."
  ],
